  "result": "{\"seen_before\": false, \"matches\": [], \"answer\": \"I found no earlier ticket that reports this problem. The archive has Shortcut Guide tickets, but they cover other things: the guide not appearing, feature requests to show PowerToys shortcuts, and a text refresh. None of them describe a changed PowerToys shortcut needing two restarts to appear. Treat this as a new bug. Your analysis is a good starting point: `PowerToysShortcutsPopulator.Populate()` runs after the index.yml generation, so the index is built from the old manifest. Moving the `Populate()` call before the index generation should make an updated shortcut show after one restart, or immediately.\"}",
